        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Justice and evil, in a moment.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Become Officer Ren and experience your police life in Baixiang Town.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>As a policeman in White Elephant Town, you received a missing case one day, a case that unravels the darkness behind it...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore the real scene</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800800/extras/11422e069f5c03d675e417a0518e2ff0.avif?t=1752726955\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800800/extras_big/11422e069f5c03d675e417a0518e2ff0.avif?t=1752726955 width=800 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restored the real scene, including police stations, towns, streets and other environmental special effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The case plot-oriented, adopts a first-person perspective and uses an immersive narrative, making people feel as if they are in it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese subtitles and voice, subtitles support English, Japanese and Korean.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the item and unlock the item.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide items and tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can explore more content by themselves!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frame rate unlock</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can limit it yourself, or unlock online FPS without online, and enjoy high frame rates!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customized picture quality</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can adjust the picture quality according to their own configuration so that every player can play!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Material</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use real material texture to enhance player immersion!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adult content description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developer said:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a game with the background of restoring a criminal case. There will be corpses and a detailed description of the crime process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will also be dark scenes, heart terror, blood stains, and dead heads in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Statement: The above scenes have tried to reduce the authenticity of the situation so that most players can reach an acceptable level, and reduce the burden on players!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Justice and evil, in a moment.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Become Officer Ren and experience your police life in Baixiang Town.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>As a policeman in White Elephant Town, you received a missing case one day, a case that unravels the darkness behind it...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore the real scene</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800800/extras/11422e069f5c03d675e417a0518e2ff0.avif?t=1752726955\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800800/extras_big/11422e069f5c03d675e417a0518e2ff0.avif?t=1752726955 width=800 height=394 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restored the real scene, including police stations, towns, streets and other environmental special effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The case plot-oriented, adopts a first-person perspective and uses an immersive narrative, making people feel as if they are in it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chinese subtitles and voice, subtitles support English, Japanese and Korean.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the item and unlock the item.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide items and tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can explore more content by themselves!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feature</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frame rate unlock</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can limit it yourself, or unlock online FPS without online, and enjoy high frame rates!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customized picture quality</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can adjust the picture quality according to their own configuration so that every player can play!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Material</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use real material texture to enhance player immersion!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adult content description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developer said:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a game with the background of restoring a criminal case. There will be corpses and a detailed description of the crime process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will also be dark scenes, heart terror, blood stains, and dead heads in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Statement: The above scenes have tried to reduce the authenticity of the situation so that most players can reach an acceptable level, and reduce the burden on players!</p>",
